b8c66fc3bff6fa4b6602"},"message":"state,change: carry LastSeen on the node online and offline patches\n\ntailcfg documents PeerChange.LastSeen as accompanying a change of online\nstatus, but the patches headscale sends on connect and disconnect carried\nonly the Online bit. A client therefore learned when a peer was last seen\nonly on the next full map.\n\nThe full map keeps reporting LastSeen for offline nodes only. Captured\ncontrol-plane netmaps carry LastSeen on offline peers and never on online\nones, which is what headscale already did.","parents":[{"sha":"5f955cb4b4bcc172094e9776f9a1e18c7069abdc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/5f955cb4b4bcc172094e9776f9a1e18c7069abdc","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/5f955cb4b4bcc172094e9776f9a1e18c7069abdc"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"id":30572454144,"node_id":"HRFPE_lADOEFLz888AAAABMSQrU88AAAAHHkKhAA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/30572454144","actor":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_typ